READ ME

# Basic instructions for running the sphere case

1. Adjust boundary conditions for various Reynolds numbers in 0/fluid/U 
2. After ./Allcean check first if the mesh is good --> ./Allmesh
3. Visualize mesh in paraView and run checkMesh 
4. then ./Allcean and then run ./Allrun -m -S (monolithic coupling in Serial, for every argument use a seperate dash!)
5. Check log.X files to check if all steps in Allrun went well.
6. Use integral from heatflux solid_fluid to calculate Nusselt numbers
7. Check nusselt numbers with Ranz-Marshall correlation.
8. Done
